**Slopes of log₂(median) over n = 48–80:**

| quantity | C1 | C3 | C2 (48–64) | HH |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| E_first | **0.203** | 0.196 | 0.227 | **0.226** (E, collision runs) |
| E_block0 | 0.203 | 0.196 | 0.227 | — |
